{"id":797404,"title":"43｜装饰器的用法","content":"装饰器是TypeScript中的一项实验性特性，用于增强类、方法、属性和参数的功能。在使用前需在tsconfig.json中开启experimentalDecorators选项。TypeScript中的装饰器分为四类：类装饰器、方法装饰器、属性装饰器和参数装饰器，每种装饰器都有特定的接口和执行顺序。装饰器本质上是一个函数，通过@符号标记，并且可以利用装饰器工厂来动态生成装饰器。装饰器的执行顺序遵循实例成员、静态成员、构造函数参数到类本身的顺序，同位置多个装饰器从下向上执行。此外，元数据（metadata）与装饰器结合使用时，可通过Reflect对象访问或定义，但仅能获取JavaScript支持的数据类型。TypeScript编译后的代码最终运行于JavaScript环境中，因此无法直接反映TypeScript特有的类型信息。理解装饰器及其元数据的执行顺序和使用方式对于前端开发框架尤为重要。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":396576,"user_name":"Vongola","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1047073,"ip_address":"澳大利亚","ucode":"F2FDAEBC049CBC","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/fa/21/abb7bfe3.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1735004353,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":143969,"content":"👍+1","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521669,"ctime":1735184549,"ip_address":"江苏","comment_id":396576,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100761001,"comment_content":"因为property的值需要在类实例化时才有，而装饰器是在类声明时执行，此时property还没有初始化，没有值。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521669,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/38/05/7beecd5d.jpg","nickname":"Aiming","note":"","ucode":"66292B32F9960A","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":655540,"discussion_content":"👍+1","content_length":3,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1735184549,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"江苏","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}